      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَنَّمٌ</span></b>  <i>A camel left unridden</i> [<i>so that he is made
to have a large hump</i>]. (K, * TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَبْرٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَنَّمٌ</span> <i>An elevated</i> [or <i>a gibbous</i>] <i>grave:</i> from
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السَّنَامُ</span>. (Mgh.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجْدٌ مُسَنَّمٌ</span> (assumed tropical:)  <i>Great glory.</i>
(M, TA.)

